{'symbol': 'AVB', 'date': '2021-02-03 16:15:00', 'title': 'AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. DECLARES FIRST QUARTER 2021 DIVIDENDS', 'text': "ARLINGTON, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. (NYSE:AVB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK (PAR VALUE $0.01 PER SHARE) FOR THE FIRST QUARTER OF 2021. THE COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND IS $1.59 PER SHARE AND IS PAYABLE APRIL 15, 2021 TO ALL COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MARCH 31, 2021. ABOUT AVALONBAY COMMUNITIES, INC. AS OF DECEMBER 31, 2020, THE COMPANY OWNED OR HELD A DIRECT OR INDIRECT OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN 291 APA"}